              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "e2ea5aee4df30f08d7d7e2bdde4775ef22b781b83719ccaf21d6b8e4781814ab"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-conversion-trace",
        "moduleId": "number-conversion",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "逐步跟踪 1348 的转换",
        "markdown": "以 $N=1348$ 为例跟踪栈的变化：$1348\\bmod 8=4$ 入栈，$168\\bmod 8=0$ 入栈，$21\\bmod 8=5$ 入栈，$2\\bmod 8=2$ 入栈，此时 $N$ 变为 0，第一个循环结束。栈自底向顶为 4、0、5、2；连续出栈得到 2、5、0、4，正好拼成 $(2504)_8$。两个循环分别对应“产生数字”和“倒序输出”两个阶段，栈把两者的衔接藏在了后进先出里。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-number-conversion",
            "tb-conversion-code",
            "tb-conversion-rationale"
          ]
        }
